{
  "$comment": "EXP-1291 Threads v2: THE session card ×4 — a session inside a thread (the root's own session first, every child where its `session` card message sits, an agent channel's `thread_started` cards) is ONE card = the Work card's HEADER row (work-card.json geometry.header px, radius lg, card hairline, no shadow): the state `icon` (concept), the `name` (medium, truncates), the muted `kindWord`, trailing the muted `elapsed` (tabular figures) with a 12px spinner in front while `running`. No device, account, branch or other caption. Tapping it opens that session's raw view (today's session view). Model = pure `sessionCard(session, title, now)` (TS reference packages/domain-contract/src/session-tree.ts; mirrors desktop domain::session_tree, iOS ExpCore SessionTree.swift, Android domain/SessionTree.kt), every mirror replays `cases` and compares the WHOLE expected object. S-3 (owner 2026-10-28): FOUR states, nothing else ×4 (no running, paused, interrupted, blocked or stale word): state = `done` when status ended, else `needs_you` when needsInput (a card, a usage wall, an unclaimed/stuck watchdog flag), else `working` when status queued or busy (background tasks included), else `idle` (between turns; an INTERRUPTION, blocked.kind device_offline/restarted, is invisible: its row reads by busy). name = `title`, the session's display title (EXP-1341 session-title.json `sessionTitle`; never `Session N`). kindWord = `copy.states[state]`, except a `needs_you` session whose blocked.kind is in `copy.blockedKinds` reads that word. elapsed ONLY while working (startedAt → now; null while queued) or done (startedAt → endedAt, else updatedAt), the work card's ladder ('37s', '2m 04s', '1h 03m'); idle and needs_you carry none (never 'Waiting 158h'); null without a parsable startedAt. running = state working. tone = `tones[state]`, icon = `icons[state]`. The Dock card = `sessionBanner(session)` (dock.json `banner` source, one model x4: web agent-session.tsx useSessionDock, desktop steer_viewer, iOS AgentSessionModel, Android AgentSessionScreen): null when ended or needsInput; `queued` (status queued: waiting for its device, #EXP-1405) or `background` (busy AND background, EXP-1374) = {id, icon = bannerIcons[id], label = bannerLabels[id], text = banner[id], tone muted, action null}; any other = null (S-3: no interrupted and no paused card ×4); `bannerCases` replay it. #EXP-1405: an IDLE session (started, not busy, not ended) shows its transcript on every device, not only the one that ran it: its viewer ticket names the host device as `live` (web `viewerHistoryClaims`), the relay asks that device to replay its journal and keeps the room up while it is watched; any failure answers the retryable `no_such_session`, never an ending.",
